{"_id":"j0FkZT7ebByM7vQP","name":"Squire","formula":"1d72","replacement":true,"displayRoll":true,"description":"","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","results":[{"_id":"XmoLFabCekWjHhgC","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(possession)\u003c/b\u003e A somewhat grand helm (A1) that’s a bit too big for them.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[1,1],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"T1TPgNpgtkB8uV8V","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(possession)\u003c/b\u003e They’re always playing a shrill flute.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[2,2],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"SaHK8f8ddf1YVExA","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(possession)\u003c/b\u003e They have fine clothes and a pouch of coins.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[3,3],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"SU2t5SVrmVbl120a","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(possession)\u003c/b\u003e A homemade shield (A1).","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[4,4],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"yOLA16K1OpvHka8l","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(possession)\u003c/b\u003e A small barrel of low quality mead.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[5,5],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"cU03beMv6exvLCK4","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(possession)\u003c/b\u003e Layers and layers of padded clothes (A1).","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[6,6],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"GGZBs40kjX91TUis","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(possession)\u003c/b\u003e Somehow, they got a crossbow ([[/r 2d8]] slow)","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[7,7],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"Jyr8G7mMx0y5iXgM","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(possession)\u003c/b\u003e They somehow got hold of some mail (A1). Do they think they’re a Knight already??","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[8,8],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"cKkjRytroW7s5jhT","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(possession)\u003c/b\u003e A tiny, low quality mirror.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[9,9],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"4rXi6IUiKmgTtaux","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(possession)\u003c/b\u003e Their parents loaded them up with Sustenance.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[10,10],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"hbOxSzAICZNQPyvx","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(possession)\u003c/b\u003e They’ve foraged enough Stimulant to go around.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[11,11],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"GY7a283eIbRoY7zC","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(possession)\u003c/b\u003e A Seer provided them with Sacrament.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[12,12],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"QZ7y3N17VAQ6u4vo","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(aptitude)\u003c/b\u003e They can sprint like a horse.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[13,13],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"6MhHO3seXAGau0U2","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(aptitude)\u003c/b\u003e They can climb like a squirrel.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[14,14],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"mLrTrbJpG02hbEZQ","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(aptitude)\u003c/b\u003e They can sing like a nightingale.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[15,15],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"aRfC5r58b4ubD77h","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(aptitude)\u003c/b\u003e They can swim like a fish.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[16,16],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"Rc2TIBtK2o4lxWJR","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(aptitude)\u003c/b\u003e They can eavesdrop like a bat.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[17,17],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"ifPAfLscQ85LMSCP","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(aptitude)\u003c/b\u003e They’re a great judge of character.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[18,18],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"aMMdvmfCpTNwR0XQ","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(aptitude)\u003c/b\u003e They’re a captivating storyteller.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[19,19],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"fYk6PLto3xabVrfZ","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(aptitude)\u003c/b\u003e They have a perfect sense of direction.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[20,20],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"Qd7pCR1yeib39Xmk","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(aptitude)\u003c/b\u003e They were highly educated.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[21,21],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"3rCSPLOTqGHI9OGG","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(aptitude)\u003c/b\u003e They’re great with horses.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[22,22],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"T98KCnHzhHBnbgkv","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(aptitude)\u003c/b\u003e They were an apprentice herbalist.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[23,23],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"XX2k2iCTs79PBPLX","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(aptitude)\u003c/b\u003e They\u0027re a decent hunter.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[24,24],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"D9jc4gjEEZOCDIEc","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(home)\u003c/b\u003e It’s far away. They only know a language that nobody in this Realm understands.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[25,25],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"SR7ZlHDXwt13a3ME","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(home)\u003c/b\u003e They’re a middling relative of the Ruler of the Realm.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[26,26],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"6ynVEvYgR1R74BfP","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(home)\u003c/b\u003e They’re heir to one of the Holdings.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[27,27],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"FuC5sdaLg08r1V9D","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(home)\u003c/b\u003e They’re already a successor to one of the Knights.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[28,28],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"Uq3fGF2fhOZIBHPE","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(home)\u003c/b\u003e They were raised by a Seer of this Realm.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[29,29],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"OpKDNulVMVZ0c9Ft","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(home)\u003c/b\u003e Their family sprawls all over this Realm.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[30,30],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"6neRiIeubnMj3gtT","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(home)\u003c/b\u003e They have a secret claim to the Seat of Power.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[31,31],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"f520CDxz5Wf6PqTT","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(home)\u003c/b\u003e Their family was wiped out for treason, so they use a false name.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[32,32],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"oekdXFhTFQRcQLYl","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(home)\u003c/b\u003e They grew up in the wilds, so their snarls are vaguely understood by animals.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[33,33],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"UUdceGO87smzPl1s","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(home)\u003c/b\u003e They come from the frozen peaks, ignoring any hardship of Winter.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[34,34],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"W8642GNSIQsd7wBh","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(home)\u003c/b\u003e They come from a realm of darkness, ignoring any problems with night.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[35,35],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"B69eO4FPEM430SmA","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(home)\u003c/b\u003e They floated up from a body of water, not needing air to breathe.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[36,36],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"1SCiEadn0n095GxN","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(companion)\u003c/b\u003e They have an old but loyal hound (\u003cspan class=\"virtue\"\u003eVIG\u003c/span\u003e 5, \u003cspan class=\"virtue\"\u003eCLA\u003c/span\u003e 7, \u003cspan class=\"virtue\"\u003eSPI\u003c/span\u003e 6, 4gd, [[/r d6]] bite)","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[37,37],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"Ux0ZTbal5NvaZ0DX","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(companion)\u003c/b\u003e They have a pet rat that they think understands them.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[38,38],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"pa6atmy70jAyvz6G","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(companion)\u003c/b\u003e They’re accompanied by an overbearing parent (rolled as another Squire, but they do not get a weapon)","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[39,39],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"LCFM0h02ByAjpEES","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(companion)\u003c/b\u003e They’re a pair of twins, identical in every way.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[40,40],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"bzC7GIR66H9V1dZ4","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(companion)\u003c/b\u003e They have a kestrel (\u003cspan class=\"virtue\"\u003eVIG\u003c/span\u003e 4, \u003cspan class=\"virtue\"\u003eCLA\u003c/span\u003e 15, \u003cspan class=\"virtue\"\u003eSPI\u003c/span\u003e 5, 3gd, [[/r d4]] talons)","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[41,41],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"LQQlRJ2En0ZgwCxH","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(companion)\u003c/b\u003e Their pony is especially violent ([[/r d6]] trample).","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[42,42],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"ShxjOcISdP1VOCg0","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(companion)\u003c/b\u003e They guard a younger sibling (roll as a Squire, but too young to fight or be useful at all)","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[43,43],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"OfKgtaiVUgj00Ca2","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(companion)\u003c/b\u003e They carry their mother’s ashes in a wooden urn.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[44,44],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"aQPAToswW9Eb9Bqk","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(companion)\u003c/b\u003e They have an embarrassing cloth doll.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[45,45],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"PuzD384gfLtfci4G","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(companion)\u003c/b\u003e They speak to their father’s skull, kept in secret.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[46,46],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"efZHelHmDUCF4aZb","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(companion)\u003c/b\u003e Their older sibling is a successful Knight, only occasionally coming by to check on them.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[47,47],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"TwtNBAzQW10eXdJt","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(companion)\u003c/b\u003e They claim to have an invisible friend. 50% chance of whether this ever manifests into anything.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[48,48],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"cMB3xtVpHtzG6DhL","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(unique)\u003c/b\u003e They’re old.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[49,49],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"k4M8eqaqLYn5PgVk","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(unique)\u003c/b\u003e They’re big. Increase \u003cspan class=\"virtue\"\u003eVIG\u003c/span\u003e to 12.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[50,50],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"cYtdpRDHpnd4Y5ec","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(unique)\u003c/b\u003e They’re smart. Increase \u003cspan class=\"virtue\"\u003eCLA\u003c/span\u003e to 12.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[51,51],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"p3WvdjlVpNELTewk","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(unique)\u003c/b\u003e They’re bold. Increase \u003cspan class=\"virtue\"\u003eSPI\u003c/span\u003e  to 12.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[52,52],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"hTSlrrYNlPZtG33i","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(unique)\u003c/b\u003e They claim to be a Knight reborn. They can Smite.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[53,53],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"pgssfMLOWNWMdC8M","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(unique)\u003c/b\u003e They fought from birth. They can Focus.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[54,54],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"fLX5aMVHOwzX5LGc","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(unique)\u003c/b\u003e They cheated death. They can Deny.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[55,55],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"9PJeg7yeoVxeBupL","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(unique)\u003c/b\u003e They secretly hate the Seers.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[56,56],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"aFZQyLbW1AtYLQR4","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(unique)\u003c/b\u003e They will not eat meat.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[57,57],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"uZV9gvyciDqQr174","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(unique)\u003c/b\u003e They cannot lie.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[58,58],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"nvh4BVHjUUudTP1r","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(unique)\u003c/b\u003e They hate horses.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[59,59],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"HeWv1bqZGewTxTEv","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(unique)\u003c/b\u003e They’ve already seen battle. Roll [[/r d12]] on the Scar table.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[60,60],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"86n0JoplrPlCGjnK","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(prophecy)\u003c/b\u003e This Squire must not fight until Knighted.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[61,61],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"NSJ20syDKn9bQRuS","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(prophecy)\u003c/b\u003e This Squire must die so that another can rise.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[62,62],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"Wo1PgKB1D5s7rkBj","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(prophecy)\u003c/b\u003e This Squire will find the City.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[63,63],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"huEbLdEceFcUJVHa","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(prophecy)\u003c/b\u003e This Squire must visit every Seer.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[64,64],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"ehtOln9bUrNjttLW","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(prophecy)\u003c/b\u003e This Squire must kill a Knight to become a Knight.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[65,65],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"WQwmlkabosROw1fB","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(prophecy)\u003c/b\u003e This Squire will become a Seer.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[66,66],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"Qy1NKGI5ahJf76PX","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(prophecy)\u003c/b\u003e This Squire must kill a Seer.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[67,67],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"YSM6NCA0NT8D2F2j","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(prophecy)\u003c/b\u003e This Squire will find the next ruler of the Realm.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[68,68],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"Smbrpc9ExYdf7j0q","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(prophecy)\u003c/b\u003e This Squire must not ride a steed.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[69,69],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"pCgLeDPzsL93iXM8","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(prophecy)\u003c/b\u003e This Squire must live in poverty.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[70,70],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"kwRfNmAxmTl9iLUO","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(prophecy)\u003c/b\u003e This Squire must never be Knighted.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[71,71],"drawn":false,"flags":{}},{"_id":"R3lt62T438PIso4z","type":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003e(prophecy)\u003c/b\u003e This Squire will achieve nothing of worth.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[72,72],"drawn":false,"flags":{}}],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
